# ── matrix repo root ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Trap: never commit a nested FMD clone here. The documentation engine lives as
# a sibling at D:\PROJECTS\FMD (github.com/delatorrecj/fmd). Operate on it with:
#   git -C D:\PROJECTS\FMD ...
/FMD/

# Python tooling cruft (from data/fetch/*.py and any top-level scripts)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Virtual environments (any level — app/.gitignore also covers app/.venv)
.venv/
venv/

# pytest caches (any level — app/.gitignore also covers app/ subtree)
.pytest_cache/

# Secrets — API keys (e.g. data/.env, app/.env). A bare `.env` pattern already
# matches at every depth; the explicit forms below are belt-and-braces so a future
# edit to one line can't silently expose a key. `.env.example` files stay tracked.
.env
**/.env
.env.local
*.local.env
*.key
credentials.json
token.json

# Intermediates (never committed, always regenerated)
.tmp/

# Claude Code agent worktrees — full checkouts (could include local .env copies);
# never add them to the parent repo.
.claude/worktrees/

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editor / IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
.gemini/
.antigravityignore
*.code-workspace
*.swp
*~

# SUMO regenerable outputs (produced by app/packages/data/build_network.py;
# regenerate with: python packages/data/build_network.py from app/)
app/packages/kernel/data/iloilo.osm
app/packages/kernel/data/iloilo.net.xml
app/packages/kernel/data/iloilo.rou.xml
app/packages/kernel/data/iloilo.taz.xml
*.sumocfg.out
tripinfo*.xml
fcd-output*.xml

# Presentation deck. The pitch deck is generated by presentation/deck/build_deck.py
# (python-pptx) from presentation/deck/_assets/ — both are tracked so it rebuilds
# from a clean clone. The AAIH-provided source template below is a heavy binary
# reference NOT consumed by the build (re-downloadable from AAIH), so it stays out.
presentation/deck/PPT Template AAIH (student).pptx
presentation/grand-final/\[SC\] PUP-ATLAN.pptx.pptx

# Note: data/raw and data/interim are ignored by data/.gitignore (nested).
# Note: app/.gitignore covers .venv, node_modules, .next, dist, etc. for app/.
# Startup-generated ledgers (also listed in app/.gitignore). CI regenerates and
# uploads them; do not commit laptop copies.
app/validation_report.md
app/credibility_report.json

.env
